# Build artifacts
*.o
*.d
main
*.so
tests/test_*
!tests/test_*.cpp
tests/bench_*
!tests/bench_*.cpp

# Data and caches. The directories themselves are kept in the tree via
# .gitkeep so a fresh clone has somewhere to write; only their contents are
# ignored. A blanket `cache/` would exclude the directory outright and git
# would refuse to descend into it, so the .gitkeep could never be re-included.
kep.dat
cache/*
!cache/.gitkeep
web_images/*
!web_images/.gitkeep
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Results fetched off a vast.ai instance, and the id of a live one. The GIFs
# run to tens of MB each - a 1280-wide 190-frame movie is ~28 MB - so a stray
# `git add .` would put a hundred megabytes of generated output into history.
vast_results/
.vast_instance_id

# Pixi environment
.pixi/

# AppImage build files
*.AppImage
AppDir/
squashfs-root/
.venv
